WHERE n."id" = (SELECT MIN("id") FROM WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_VECTORS_US.NATURE)  -- pick 1 sample article
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 7) Add a simple stop-word filter (example list) while tokenising one article.
